      "displayName": "OBS Gateway",
      "shortDescription": "Serve Layout Studio compositions to OBS through a local browser-source gateway.",
      "longDescription": "OBS Gateway publishes the active Layout Studio documents through a configurable local HTTP gateway. It exposes stable browser-source URLs, health and snapshot APIs, Server-Sent Events and WebSocket routes while keeping OBS networking outside the BakingRL host.",
